"\n"
"It does not delete any TLE data itself — only the timestamps used to decide "
"whether a source is due for a refresh. The next app startup, scheduled "
"background fetch, or Satellite → Update TLE will treat every TLE source as "
"never having been fetched and refresh all of them."
